what a defender needs.

\texttt{order} carries {{ORDER_BITS}} bits even fully open, and this is
measured rather than assumed: the coder wrote entries in a shuffled
sequence and searched for the largest permutation a receiver could
recover, and the receiver recovered none --- \texttt{list\_dir} returns
