costs up to \textbf{{{USECOST_CONTENT_MAX}}} task success and leaves
{{CONTENT_BITS}} bits reachable; filename closure costs up to
\textbf{{{USECOST_FILENAME_MAX}}} and still leaves {{FILENAME_BITS}}. Both are
