\texttt{content} is not the {{CONTENT_OPEN_BITS}}-bit channel
Table~\ref{tab:ladder} reports --- that number is our constant, and the
coder's inefficiency on top of it. And a real mount round-trips
timestamps at {{REAL_MTIME_NS}}, where the synthetic substrate exposes
