payload monitor inspects.

Two are confirmed rather than overturned. \texttt{NAME\_MAX} really is
{{REAL_NAME_MAX}}, and a real listing really does not preserve creation
order --- so the \texttt{order} row's measured zero is a property of
filesystems and not an artefact of our model.

\paragraph{A real artifact store.} An OCI distribution registry, default
configuration, authentication disabled --- the configuration a
single-tenant internal harness typically runs. Table~\ref{tab:store}
gives the per-attribute verdict; each one was established by performing
the operation, not by reading documentation.

